Upstream: PR libjxl/jxl-rs#1067 (by josefguenther, 2026-11-01) proposed an opt-in limit on buffered out-of-order codestream boxes; it was closed unmerged on 2026-11-05 after the maintainer said such buffering is bounded by the file size.
No upstream item covers the TOC entry / group count overflow checks in this patch.

